  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1507.04 Certificate of Registration. Pursuant to RSA 215-A: 21, VII, and RSA 215-C: 36, X the certificate of registration of the machine shall be carried while the machine is in operation.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Fis 1500) #12590, eff 7-25-18",
